            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Effective July 1, 1997, the level and type of Retiree Medical Benefits for the Eligible Participants shall be governed by the GTE RETIREE OPTIONS Summary Plan Description, which may be amended or discontinued by the Company at its discretion subject to paragraph 8 below.",
