        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. In order to receive Retiree Medical Benefits, the retiree must pay a percentage of the Retiree Medical premium (\"Retiree Contribution Percentage\"). Similarly, the Company will pay a percentage of the premium (\"Company Contribution Percentage\"), subject to Section 5 below. During the term of this Memorandum of Agreement, the Company and Retiree Contribution Percentages will be based on the following contribution:",
